    "The algorithm leverages color coding to manage the approvals and their contributions to the objective function.",
    "Color coding allows for a structured way to handle the complexities of the voting scenario.",
    "The overall running time of the algorithm is 2^{O(k · k! Δ_C)} · n · m.",
    "The reduction confirms the FPT status of Generalized Thiele.",
    "The reduction provides a framework for efficiently solving Generalized Thiele under the specified parameterization.",
    "This framework is particularly useful for practical applications in structured elections."
] 

